1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,478
The disagreement was about the level of the result.

2
00:00:02,478 --> 00:00:08,183
“If we extend the trial, the wait is permanent,” Maya said.

3
00:00:08,183 --> 00:00:25,076
“If we pull it back, the current of data will drag us to the start.” At the end of a long talk, four of the group held one view and the rest held another, and the period of the launch had already been extended twice.

4
00:00:25,076 --> 00:00:35,670
The action they agreed on was small: acquire one more sensor, restore the old lamp, and cap the pipe that emitted the raw carbon.

5
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:47,184
The mask, the tissue, and the plain dot on the screen were the only evidence in the room, and the dim light made the skeleton of the machine look like a creature.

6
00:00:47,184 --> 00:01:03,642
A chemist in the biochemistry lab explained the mechanics of the failure: a lag in the acceleration of the reaction, an explosive mixture of hydrogen and gasoline vapour, and a pitch of the sensor that nobody had ever calibrated.

7
00:01:03,642 --> 00:01:14,631
Across the corridor, the busy lab and the quiet one were a mile apart in length but not in kind, and they had to get the answer together.

8
00:01:14,631 --> 00:01:18,485
“You may not quit,” the officer said.

9
00:01:18,485 --> 00:01:35,054
“The formality of a signature is not a cure.” The endless bounce of the cursor, the bright exit sign, and the small dots that circulated on the screen: it was a phenomenon that none of the four could name.

10
00:01:35,054 --> 00:01:44,443
They were asked to hold the line on one point only: nothing would be acquired, not one byte, without a written reason.

11
00:01:44,443 --> 00:01:53,797
At this elevation, with the anchorage of a hundred years of practice behind them, the answer was not going to be simple.

12
00:01:53,797 --> 00:01:58,627
One team would recover; one would not.

13
00:01:58,627 --> 00:02:03,867
Perhaps the launch would be off for a season; perhaps for good.

14
00:02:03,867 --> 00:02:13,105
The development of the service and the safety of the people in it were on the same table, and the time had come to choose which one would pay.

15
00:02:13,105 --> 00:02:17,680
Nobody in the room wanted to be the one who said it first.

16
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:27,718
Across the table, the four of them could not get past the same question, and the end of the period was still on.
